---
description: Core agent rules and skill index
alwaysApply: true
---
Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root (rules, autonomy, delegation, git). Start each session by reading `docs/STATUS.md`.

Skills live in `.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`. When a task matches one, read that file and follow it:

| Skill | Use when |
|---|---|
| checkpoint | resume after a break, or save state at the end of a session |
| plan | development plan, architecture plan, delivery plan, scoping |
| slice | starting, building or closing a unit of work |
| orchestrate | autonomous multi-worker delivery |
| long-run | overnight or multi-day runs, context-loss survival |
| monitor | progress, health and cost visibility of a run |
| record-decision | a decision is made |
| backend / frontend / database / testing | code, schema or tests in that area |
| delivery | releasing, versioning, rollout, rollback |
| handoff | passing work between machines or assistants |
| claude-cli / cursor-cli | driving the other vendor's CLI as a worker |
